{"segs": ["PA_ja_45:0.2", "PA_ja_45:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Atthakāmavagga (The Section on Those Desiring Welfare)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_45:0.4"], "en": "5. The Rohiṇī Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_45:1.1", "PA_ja_45:1.2"], "en": "Better is a wise enemy than a foolish one who shows compassion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_45:1.3"], "en": "\"Behold the wretched Rohiṇī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_45:1.4"], "en": "who grieves after having killed her own mother.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_45:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the fifth Jātaka, the Rohiṇī Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
